          "text": "HAO Shuo 郝碩 (T. 冀軒), d. 1784, member of the Chinese Bordered Yellow Banner, and official who was active in the cause of the literary inquisition, was a native of Pa-chou, Chihli. His father, Hao Yü-lin 郝玉麟 (T. 敬亭, d.",
